description:
Southern Water is developing a programme to transform and rationalise its data centre estate. This Request for Information (RFI) is a preliminary market engagement exercise under the Procurement Act 2023, intended to inform and shape the emerging vision ahead of any procurement. Through it, Southern Water is seeking to:
•	Understand the capability, capacity and appetite of the market to deliver a programme of this nature;
•	Test the feasibility and realism of the emerging vision, and in particul
